Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:25:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Owner, Manager and Cashier and the one check that
 protects profit

role_tiers.py places every signed-in user as owner, manager or cashier from
the roles they already hold (no role record is created or changed), and holds
require_access(), the single check a protected call makes first. get_my_access
tells the screens which kind of person is signed in.

profit_api.get_profit_summary is the first call behind it: a cashier is refused
before anything is read; an owner or manager gets the same profit figures the
dashboard uses today.

